  "content_id": "16136210",
  "title": "Tezos XTZ Network Fees",
  "description": "Tezos (XTZ) Network – Smart Contracts with Low, Predictable Fees\nTezos offers smart contract functionality with self-amending governance a...",
  "body": "<h1 id=\"h_01JSZ621T4EV4C5WH1686RCQP8\">Tezos (XTZ) Network – Smart Contracts with Low, Predictable Fees</h1><p class=\"no-margin\">Tezos offers smart contract functionality with self-amending governance and efficient transaction fees.</p><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ621T4Z3M34D8MCYPS85AB\">How XTZ Fees Work</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Flat minimal fees</b>, paid in <b>XTZ</b>.</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Fees may vary slightly depending on network load and smart contract complexity.</p></li></ul><p class=\"no-margin\">Edge dynamically estimates the best fee for your transaction.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ621T4KZPVTYEW3P3PNSE6\">Fee Options Available</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>High</b> – For quick inclusion</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Optimal (default)</b> – Best balance</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Low</b> – Save a little more</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Custom</b> – Full manual fee setup</p></li></ul><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ621T4YYXJSRZKK2468P7W\">Average Cost</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Typically <b>$0.002 to $0.05 USD</b> per transaction.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ621T4BT7VCWPS41BVJFQW\">Why It Matters</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Tezos provides efficient smart contracts and payments without crazy gas spikes. Edge makes sending XTZ smooth and easy with smart, automatic fee estimation.</p>",
